        "id": 40558,
        "name": "lugaru",
        "username": "lugaru",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lugaru/{size}/2767_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-10-19T13:47:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, when I played the game originally I was like \"I love how simple this system is, but I fear there is not much they can do with it\".</p><p>Nightmist challenges that a little by being very flexible yet straightforward, and I agree that she is more fun before you get Master, but if you want to actually WIN it is a good idea to get it out early... there is no prize for fighting with one hand behind your back.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Btw... I love flipping her deck and trash&nbsp;so almost everything is in the trash and then using that to heal her... I forget the card names for that combo but it is great.</p>",
